  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "やけた　もくたんに　いのちが　やどりポケモンになった。　もえる　とうしできょうてきにも　たたかいを　いどむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "불탄 숯에 영혼이 깃들어서 포켓몬이 되었다. 타오르는 투지로 강한 상대에게도 싸움을 건다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生命寄宿在燃燒的木炭上變成了寶可夢。即使敵人再強，也會以燃燒的鬥志迎面而戰。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon est un charbon de bois consumé qui a pris vie. Il est animé par un désir de combattre qui le pousse à défier des adversaires puissants.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ein verbranntes Stück Holzkohle ist als Pokémon zum Leben erwacht. Es fordert selbst starke Gegner heraus und hat einen feurigen Kampfgeist.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nació de unos restos de carbón consumidos por las llamas. Reta a rivales poderosos para saciar su ardiente espíritu combativo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Del carbone bruciato ha preso vita, divenendo un Pokémon. Sfida anche i nemici più temibili, mosso da un rovente spirito combattivo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Burnt charcoal came to life and became a Pokémon. Possessing a fiery fighting spirit, Charcadet will battle even tough opponents.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "焼けた　木炭に　命が　宿りポケモンになった。　燃える　闘志で強敵にも　戦いを　挑む。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "生命寄宿在燃烧的木炭上，变成了宝可梦。即使面对强敌，也会以燃烧的斗志来迎战。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Nació de unos restos de carbón consumidos por las llamas. Reta a rivales poderosos para saciar su ardiente espíritu combativo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "たたかいになると　かりょくが　あがりせっし１０００どに　たっする。ゆぶんのおおい　きのみを　このむ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "싸움을 시작하면 화력이 상승하여 섭씨 1000도에 이르게 된다. 기름기가 많은 나무열매를 좋아한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "在進入戰鬥狀態後，火力會上升至攝氏１０００度。喜歡吃油脂含量高的樹果。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ses puissantes flammes atteignent les 1 000 °C lorsqu’il se bat. Il aime les Baies riches en matières grasses.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Kampf erreichen seine Flammen Temperaturen von bis zu 1000 ℃. Es hat eine Vorliebe für Beeren mit hohem Fettgehalt.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus potentes llamas alcanzan los 1000 ºC cuando combate. Siente predilección por las bayas con un alto contenido graso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "La sua energia termica aumenta di intensità durante le lotte, raggiungendo i 1.000 ºC. Adora le bacche ricche di grassi.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Its firepower increases when it fights, reaching over 1,800 degrees Fahrenheit. It likes berries that are rich in fat.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "戦いになると　火力が　上がり摂氏１０００度に　達する。油分の多い　木の実を　好む。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
